<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC lower rates on most cash bonds.</title>
<headline>SBC lower rates on most cash bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp. said it was lowering the interest rate on most of its cash bonds (Kassenobligationen) with effect from May 27.</p>
<p>  CASH BOND		 NEW RATE	   OLD RATE</p>
<p> Two years		  1.75 pct	   1.75 pct</p>
<p> Three years		2.00 pct	   2.25 pct</p>
<p> Four years		 2.25 pct	   2.50 pct</p>
<p> Five years		 2.50 pct	   2.75 pct</p>
<p> Six years		  2.75 pct	   3.00 pct</p>
<p> Seven years		3.00 pct	   3.25 pct</p>
<p> Eight years		3.25 pct	   3.50 pct</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
